    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing, it doesn't feel temporary. it feels like the foundation is just gone. if the work is gone, then there's no point to any of it. it's just a loop of trying to build something that keeps falling apart. like i'm just stuck in this cycle of failure and i'm so tired of fighting it. sometimes i think everything would just be easier if i didn't have to face the consequences of being this much of a disappointment. i just want the noise to stop.",
